      "scope": "Complete WifiInfo events in a general-purpose iOS container",
      "reason": "The public fetchCurrent result guarantees SSID, BSSID and security type. Its signalStrength is HotspotHelper-only and it has no frequency property. Use the separately registered partial-info subscription; a complete measurement cannot be fabricated.",
